#ASSERT `s 515(2.1) the judge, justice or court may name particular persons as sureties` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2.11) args: the offence of the conviction; the date of the conviction; the day the release order is made; satisfied that no other suitable surety is available and naming is in the interests of justice (the ten years are read as including the day ten years before: fork)
