#ASSERT `s 515(3) the justice must consider the factor` `s 515(3) a factor the text does not name` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4) args: the justice makes an order under (2); the condition; the justice considers it necessary for the safety and security of a victim or witness; it is reasonable and the justice considers it desirable
#ASSERT `s 515(4) the justice may direct the accused to comply with the condition` TRUE `s 515(4)(a) report at specified times to a peace officer, or other person, designated in the order` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
